DAO

This directory contains all DAO classes responsible for interacting with the database.

DAOs handle:

- Fetching, inserting, updating, and deleting data
- Abstracting SQL queries from the rest of the application
- Returning data in a consistent format (arrays, objects, or entities)

Controllers and services should not directly execute SQL queries. All database interactions should go through DAOs.

---------------------
DAO Structure

- Each DAO class represents a table or entity (e.g., UserDAO.php, MessageDAO.php)
- All DAO classes are inside the App\Data namespace